      378.61,
      539.97,
      449.68
    ],
    "text": "I. Kajitan Lalith Wanigarathne, being the Western Provincial Minister of Roads, Transport, Co-operative Development andTrade, Fisheries, Housing and Construction, Urban and Estate Sector Infrastructure Facilities, Industries and Rural Developmentdo hereby announce that Mr. Lionel Appuhami, member of the Director Board of Western Provincial Industrial DevelopmentAuthority was removed with immediate effect from the Director Board membership of the said Western Provicial IndustrialDevelopment Authority as per powers assigned to me under Section 29 (2) of the Industrial Development Authority Statute(Western Province) No. 02 of 1994.",
